WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:02.295
Let's talk about
the purity rings.

00:00:04.672 --> 00:00:06.925
For those of you who don't know,

00:00:06.925 --> 00:00:09.427
purity rings are
worn to demonstrate

00:00:09.427 --> 00:00:11.972
that you're abstaining
from sex before marriage

00:00:11.972 --> 00:00:14.265
and the Jonas brothers,
they all had them.

00:00:14.265 --> 00:00:16.183
Look, I know this is a roast

00:00:16.183 --> 00:00:18.478
and you will think I
should be going after them.

00:00:18.478 --> 00:00:21.898
But I think we need to set
the record straight here.

00:00:21.898 --> 00:00:24.483
No, the rings weren't
a good idea.

00:00:25.402 --> 00:00:30.157
Yes, as a gesture they're laughably,
toe-curlingly lame.

00:00:31.323 --> 00:00:35.995
But remember this was
about more than a gesture.

00:00:35.995 --> 00:00:37.663
This was about faith.

00:00:37.663 --> 00:00:38.998
This was about principle.

00:00:38.998 --> 00:00:42.627
This was about taking a
stand and setting an example.

00:00:42.627 --> 00:00:44.712
Look, Joe Jonas wasn't
just sticking his fingers

00:00:44.712 --> 00:00:45.838
in some dumb metal rings.

00:00:45.838 --> 00:00:49.133
He was sticking his fingers in
co-stars, actresses,

00:00:49.675 --> 00:00:52.345
and even a super model or two.

